# Line endings are load-bearing in this repository.
#
# Skills ship bash scripts, and Git for Windows checks out with core.autocrlf=true by default —
# so without this file an install on Windows lands a CRLF copy of them. A CRLF bash script does
# not degrade, it dies: `set -euo pipefail\r` is an "invalid option name", and the `-e` that was
# already applied turns that into an immediate exit. The script then does nothing, silently.
#
# So: LF in the working tree, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries, should any ever land here: never touch them. Evidence directories (screenshots,
# screen recordings) are gitignored in consuming projects, but templates and fixtures may
# eventually carry an image.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
